{"acronym":null,"arm_groups":[],"brief_summary":"The purpose of the study is to see how safe and effective and tolerable the use of colesevelam hydrochloride is for type 2 diabetes when added to metformin alone or in combination with other anti-diabetic drugs.","brief_title":"WelChol® With Metformin in Treating Patients With Type 2 Diabetes","collaborators":[],"completion_date":{"date":"2006-07","type":"ACTUAL"},"conditions":["Type 2 Diabetes"],"design":{"allocation":"RANDOMIZED","intervention_model":"PARALLEL","masking":"DOUBLE","primary_purpose":"TREATMENT","who_masked":[]},"eligibility":{"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Age 18-75 years, inclusive\n* Diagnosed with type 2 diabetes\n* Hemoglobin (HbA1c) between 7.5% to 9.5%\n* Prescribed an ADA accepted diet\n* Receiving stable dose of metformin alone or in combination with other oral anti-diabetic medications for 90 days before Visit 1\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* History of type 1 diabetes or ketoacidosis\n* History of chronic (more than 2 months) insulin therapy or the initiation of insulin for chronic treatment\n* History of pancreatitis\n* Uncontrolled hypertension\n* Recent severe cardiovascular disease\n* Allergy or toxic response to colesevelam or any of its components\n* Body mass index (BMI) \\>45 kg/m2","healthy_volunteers":false,"maximum_age":"75 Years","minimum_age":"18 Years","sex":"ALL","std_ages":["ADULT","OLDER_ADULT"]},"enrollment":{"count":300,"type":null},"first_posted":"2005-09-07","has_results":false,"interventions":[{"name":"Colesevelam hydrochloride","other_names":[],"type":"DRUG"}],"last_known_status":null,"last_update_posted":"2012-01-18","lead_sponsor":{"class":"INDUSTRY","name":"Daiichi Sankyo"},"nct_id":"NCT00147719","official_title":"A Multi-Center, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Parallel-Group Study of the Efficacy and Safety of WelChol® in Type 2 Diabetics With Inadequate Glycemic Control on Metformin Monotherapy or Metformin Therapy in Combination With Other Oral A